:: Noah Hang Out Go To Park [nobr]

/* Intro */
You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> if he wants to go to the park and he smiles as wide as if you’d ask him if he wants extra desert. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yes, yes, yes!”</span> <span style="color:Pink">He jumps up and down cutely, his small body overcome with excitement at the thought of going to the park with his big brother.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh! Can you go down that SUPER big slide with me? It’s, like, taller than our house and goes soooo fast!”</span><br>

<<set _ad to [
	{
		Name: "Noah",
		State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
			Mouth: "Happy",
		},
	},
	{
		Name: "Player",
		State: {
