		},
	},
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Agree<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You laugh and agree, telling <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> that you can do all sorts of fun things. <span style="color:Pink">You ruffle his hair and smile at the boy, who is bouncing up and down with excitement.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Aaaah~! I can’t wait! Oh, we also gotta play on the swings! If you push me super high, I can jump off and it’s like I’m flying! Oh! We should also play tag, I’m one of the fastest kids in my class and-”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> rambles on as you walk, <span style="color:Pink">cutely describing all the fun you are going to have.</span> <br>
        <br>
