    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Is he too scared to go down by himself?<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        With a teasing smirk, you ask if <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> is too scared to go down the slide on his own. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“N- no!”</span> <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> blushes at this, his cheeks puffing out as if he’s offended.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’m not scared! I just think it would be funner if we went down together.”</span> He pauses for a moment, looking down at his feet as you continue walking with a nervous expression. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“B- but we should go down together… you know, because it is more fun.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">You can’t help but smile at how cute your little brother is.</span> <br>
        <br>
